WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.799 --> 00:00:08.759
You do know

00:00:08.842 --> 00:00:11.011
you need not dress
so formally here?

00:00:14.723 --> 00:00:18.352
Does this
meet your approval?

00:00:18.435 --> 00:00:20.354
Oh, without question.

00:00:26.902 --> 00:00:28.987
Your Grace, should we...

00:00:30.197 --> 00:00:31.406
go upstairs?

00:00:31.490 --> 00:00:32.741
I have a better idea.

00:00:37.412 --> 00:00:39.498
Where are we going?

00:00:39.581 --> 00:00:40.415
Out!

00:01:20.163 --> 00:01:22.082
-So?
-Yes?

00:01:22.624 --> 00:01:25.627
Now that we have returned
to the motherland,

00:01:26.378 --> 00:01:28.630
we must revert
to our real identities.

00:01:29.548 --> 00:01:30.799
So, if you see me
on the street...

00:01:30.883 --> 00:01:34.428
Yes, of course.
I am a true professional.

00:01:38.765 --> 00:01:40.767
It's been a pleasure
working with you, comrade.

00:01:42.936 --> 00:01:43.896
Pleasure's mine.

00:01:51.236 --> 00:01:52.571
Wait, wait, wait.

00:01:54.823 --> 00:01:55.991
Really?

00:01:56.074 --> 00:01:57.117
That's it?

00:01:58.202 --> 00:02:01.079
You're just gonna walk away
like this never happened?

00:02:02.414 --> 00:02:03.999
That's what
professionals do, right?

00:02:04.082 --> 00:02:06.126
Sarah, I just had
the best day of my life.

00:02:07.294 --> 00:02:08.795
John B,
you're gonna blow our cover.

00:02:08.879 --> 00:02:11.089
Look, I don't care
about my cover, Sarah.

00:02:11.173 --> 00:02:13.091
I don't care
if my friends find out

00:02:13.175 --> 00:02:15.219
or your boyfriend
with his frosty tips.

00:02:15.302 --> 00:02:16.136
Look, yesterday,

00:02:16.220 --> 00:02:17.554
I, I didn't even know
who you were.

00:02:19.681 --> 00:02:21.058
And today, I'm like...

00:02:23.435 --> 00:02:24.603
Sarah Cameron.

00:02:26.188 --> 00:02:27.773
And honestly,
in my limited experience,

00:02:27.856 --> 00:02:28.690
that's rare.

00:02:28.774 --> 00:02:31.026
That's like,
like eclipse rare,

00:02:31.109 --> 00:02:32.319
like a blind person

00:02:32.402 --> 00:02:33.904
seeing colour
for the first time rare

00:02:33.987 --> 00:02:36.740
or like Bigfoot evidence
or the Northern lights.

00:02:36.823 --> 00:02:39.451
Look, I can't pretend
like this isn't real.

00:02:40.494 --> 00:02:42.079
Like this didn't happen.

00:02:42.162 --> 00:02:43.247
-I'm sorry.
-Shut up.

00:02:50.879 --> 00:02:52.381
I can't pretend either.

00:02:57.594 --> 00:02:59.930
Hey, man. Get a room.

00:03:02.724 --> 00:03:04.852
Hi. It's me again.

00:03:04.935 --> 00:03:05.853
Is Maeve here?

00:03:05.936 --> 00:03:07.855
Yeah. Yeah.
She's in the back garden.

00:03:15.028 --> 00:03:15.904
Hey.

00:03:17.072 --> 00:03:18.615
Hi. What are you doing here?

00:03:19.700 --> 00:03:22.202
I...
I needed to talk to you.

00:03:23.537 --> 00:03:24.705
What's, what's going on.

00:03:28.709 --> 00:03:29.877
It was never
about the clinic.

00:03:30.836 --> 00:03:32.129
I did the clinic
to be close to you.

00:03:33.505 --> 00:03:36.216
And then you made me realise
I'm good at something.

00:03:37.134 --> 00:03:38.385
And I like helping people.

00:03:40.053 --> 00:03:41.638
And I thought
you ignored my message

00:03:41.722 --> 00:03:43.015
and it crushed my heart.

00:03:43.098 --> 00:03:44.266
And I stopped
doing the clinic

00:03:44.349 --> 00:03:46.226
because it reminded me
of you and it sucked.

00:03:48.187 --> 00:03:49.229
So, I wanna help people.

00:03:51.565 --> 00:03:53.400
And I know this is only
about the money for you,

00:03:53.483 --> 00:03:57.029
but... let's just be a team.
Again. Please?

00:03:57.112 --> 00:03:58.739
Because if I can't
be with you romantically,

00:03:58.822 --> 00:04:00.407
I still wanna see you
every day.

00:04:01.617 --> 00:04:03.452
Nothing feels right
when you're not around.

00:04:04.661 --> 00:04:06.288
It wasn't just
about the money for me.

00:04:08.248 --> 00:04:09.541
I wanted to be close too.

00:04:25.057 --> 00:04:26.058
Noah!

00:05:19.486 --> 00:05:20.821
Why didn't you write me?

00:05:22.406 --> 00:05:23.782
Why?

00:05:24.533 --> 00:05:25.951
It wasn't over for me.

00:05:26.827 --> 00:05:29.121
I waited for you
for seven years

00:05:29.705 --> 00:05:31.039
and now it's too late.

00:05:32.249 --> 00:05:34.334
I wrote you 365 letters.

00:05:36.962 --> 00:05:38.547
I wrote you every day
for a year.

00:05:39.965 --> 00:05:41.842
-You wrote me?
-Yes!

00:05:43.343 --> 00:05:44.178
It wasn't over.

00:05:46.430 --> 00:05:47.764
Still isn't over.

00:05:55.814 --> 00:05:57.024
Sure I can't give you
a ride home?

00:05:58.734 --> 00:06:01.236
I think if my mom saw me
getting off your motorcycle,

00:06:01.320 --> 00:06:02.696
she'd come out
with a shotgun.

00:06:04.198 --> 00:06:05.199
That's fair enough.

00:06:07.534 --> 00:06:08.785
Jug?

00:06:11.997 --> 00:06:13.373
What you said at Pop's.

00:06:15.459 --> 00:06:16.502
I heard you.

00:06:18.587 --> 00:06:21.381
Whatever you need to do
or explore.

00:06:22.633 --> 00:06:23.842
I support you.

00:06:36.355 --> 00:06:38.357
You have a knack
for getting in trouble.

00:06:39.191 --> 00:06:41.235
You have a knack
for saving my life.

00:06:41.318 --> 00:06:43.403
I think
I have a superhero stalker.

00:06:43.487 --> 00:06:45.531
I was in the neighbourhood.

00:06:47.407 --> 00:06:49.493
You are amazing.

00:06:50.994 --> 00:06:52.412
Some people don't think so.

00:06:54.831 --> 00:06:55.874
But you are.

00:06:56.458 --> 00:06:57.751
Nice to have a fan.

00:06:58.710 --> 00:07:00.671
Do I get
to say thank you this time?

00:07:03.048 --> 00:07:03.882
Wait.

00:07:43.046 --> 00:07:44.047
I'm sorry.

00:07:44.756 --> 00:07:45.924
I'm so sorry for...

00:07:47.634 --> 00:07:48.552
what you've been through.

00:07:51.763 --> 00:07:52.723
Nobody forced me to...

00:07:53.390 --> 00:07:54.600
get behind the wheel
that night.

00:07:54.683 --> 00:07:55.601
That's a...

00:07:56.768 --> 00:07:58.187
that's a choice I live with.

00:07:58.270 --> 00:07:59.521
Yeah, but everything else.

00:07:59.605 --> 00:08:01.440
Ryan manipulating
the justice system.

00:08:01.982 --> 00:08:02.941
Somebody should stop him.

00:08:03.025 --> 00:08:04.735
I volunteer happily.

00:08:04.818 --> 00:08:06.486
Well, I am working on it.

00:08:07.446 --> 00:08:10.073
I just met a new lawyer
for dinner last night.

00:08:10.657 --> 00:08:12.492
Lawyer,
you weren't on a date.

00:08:13.243 --> 00:08:15.913
He thinks
joint custody is doable

00:08:15.996 --> 00:08:18.790
if I can just show
how I'm really doing now.

00:08:19.541 --> 00:08:20.501
And judge sees it.

00:08:21.460 --> 00:08:24.296
If was sure
Ryan could never find us,

00:08:24.379 --> 00:08:27.508
I would grab Juliet
and run to Paris.

00:08:29.051 --> 00:08:31.803
And spend our days
drawing outside Sacré-Cœur.

00:08:34.598 --> 00:08:36.099
That sounds magical.

00:08:36.183 --> 00:08:37.142
For you.

00:08:37.226 --> 00:08:40.187
Tragic for me to lose you.

00:08:40.270 --> 00:08:42.814
I shouldn't have reduced you
to my issues.

00:08:42.898 --> 00:08:44.149
You're nothing
like my mother.

00:08:44.233 --> 00:08:46.068
You adore your child
and she should be with you.

00:08:46.151 --> 00:08:48.529
You're just who you are.

00:08:49.488 --> 00:08:51.532
You don't hide or embellish,

00:08:51.615 --> 00:08:52.783
you own your mistakes

00:08:52.866 --> 00:08:55.077
and stand up
to the strikes against you.

00:08:55.160 --> 00:08:56.161
You're so...

00:08:59.373 --> 00:09:02.543
Oh no! Please no.

00:09:04.545 --> 00:09:07.965
It's okay. Look.
I think it's just us.

00:09:57.431 --> 00:10:00.017
Oh shit.
Love is gonna kill you.

